# The 45 capabilities no corpus unit and no dictionary entry had reached by 2026-09-20: mutation
# cannot assemble a token like `$math_sin(` out of fragments, so the dictionary hands it over.
# (That audit counted 47 dark; `int`/`float` were false positives -- they are called bare, so a
# `$`-prefixed search missed them. These are the bare-call spellings too.)
